  "body": "### Summary\n\nProposed by Bybifok (GitHub moust4ki, 2026-10-26): iPhone Duo / iPad columns — two columns unfolded, tabs in a rail folded, sidebar pinned or on demand\n\n### Blocked by\n\n- #237\n\n\n### Scope\n\n**iPhone Duo / iPad columns**: two columns unfolded, tabs in a rail folded, sidebar pinned or on demand\n\n- Phase: 4 (M4, operator 2026-11-09) · Priority: high · Status: spec · Lot: LOT-147 (#237)\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\nEngine dependencies as written: —\n\n### Open questions\n\nThe design of the additions (tab rail when folded, pinned or on-demand sidebar: opt-in settings, off by default) is written in the LOT-147 spec and approved by the operator on #237 before code.\n\n### Spec\n\n`docs/lots/LOT-147-duo-ipad-columns.md` carries the whole feature: the legacy Duo layout at `2fe43da3` and the FEAT-016 additions (no separate `docs/features/FEAT-016.md`). LOT-147's PR closes this issue.\n\n### Source\n\n[docs/FEATURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FEATURES.md), [research/bybifok-proposals.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/research/bybifok-proposals.md); proposal credit stays with Bybifok (CREDITS.md).\n\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
